Package: libgxde-decoration3-x11-6
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 gxde-decoration3-x11-data (= ${source:Version}),
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: window decoration library for GXDE KWin X11
 gxde-decoration3-x11 is GXDE's build of the KDecoration 3 plugin based
 library for creating window decorations. Its libraries, CMake package,
 include directory and translation domain use a GXDE-specific name so that
 it can be installed next to the distribution KDecoration 3 packages.
 .
 This package contains the decoration API library used by decoration
 themes.

Package: libgxde-decoration3-x11-private2
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
 ${shlibs:Depends},
Description: window decoration library for GXDE KWin X11 - private API
 gxde-decoration3-x11 is GXDE's build of the KDecoration 3 plugin based
 library for creating window decorations.
 .
 This package contains the private library implemented by the window
 manager side (for example gxde-kwin_x11).

Package: gxde-decoration3-x11-data
Section: localization
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Depends:
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: window decoration library for GXDE KWin X11 - translations
 gxde-decoration3-x11 is GXDE's build of the KDecoration 3 plugin based
 library for creating window decorations.
 .
 This package contains the translations.

Package: libgxde-decoration3-x11-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends:
 libgxde-decoration3-x11-6 (= ${binary:Version}),
 libgxde-decoration3-x11-private2 (= ${binary:Version}),
 qt6-base-dev (>= 6.8.0~),
 ${misc:Depends},
Description: window decoration library for GXDE KWin X11 - development files
 gxde-decoration3-x11 is GXDE's build of the KDecoration 3 plugin based
 library for creating window decorations.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the CMake package
 (find_package(gxde-decoration3-x11)) for building decoration themes and
 window managers against gxde-decoration3-x11.
